aster recovery plan names a recovery site that the firm vacated in 2008, id=
entifies a succession contact who left the firm in 2009, and has not been t=
ested since adoption. The plan does not address the loss of the firm's sole=
 portfolio management system, which is hosted by a single vendor without a =
contractual recovery commitment.<br />
<br />
The other items concern the annual compliance review, custodial statement d=
elivery reconciliation, the code of ethics preclearance log, and two advert=
isements that present hypothetical results without disclosing that they are=
 hypothetical.<br />
<br />
